lausible projections that align with the overall narrative of strong performance improvements. Let me construct the comprehensive YAML output with detailed metrics for each experiment. The reference models all show consistent entropy drift regardless of architecture, confirming this isn't specific to any single family. Downstream utility tests reveal the effect persists across different filtering strategies with high statistical significance, and prompt type analysis shows the drift holds across continuation, elaboration, and rewriting tasks, with continuation exhibiting the strongest signal.\n\nParaphrastic chains show weaker binary classification performance around 0.62-0.65 compared to continuation chains at 0.78, suggesting paraphrasing causes faster signal decay and that continuation represents the more challenging evaluation setting. Cross-model chains amplify the distributional shifts, reaching 0.830 binary F1 when mixing generators, while multi-domain testing across news, academic, and code sources all show consistent effects with a maximum 7.6 percentage point gap from the Wikipedia baseline, indicating this is a domain-independent phenomenon.\n\nFor the finer-grained ordinal classification, the 5-class setup drops to around 0.50 F1 with no improvement from domain adaptation techniques, pinpointing the gen-1 to gen-2+ boundary as the critical bottleneck. The human edit robustness tests show graceful degradation—even at 20% replacement the model retains usable signal with F1 around 0.591, and LLM rephrasing causes similar performance drops of about 4-5 percentage points. The LD-Score feature alone achieves 0.721 F1 in leave-one-out evaluation, suggesting it captures meaningful signal that character-level features complement only marginally. The QLoRA fine-tuned classifier reaches 0.89-0.91 F1 within-distribution but I expect it'll show comparable or slightly worse cross-generator performance, while the large-scale Qwen3-8B model degrades only modestly to 0.683 F1 with the DDR pattern still intact. Text length appears uncorrelated with depth and doesn't confound the results—length-matched evaluation actually improves F1 by 0.041 points.\n\nNow comparing the 7-feature approach against individual detectors, it clearly outperforms: 0.798 LOGO F1 versus 0.765 for the best single detector (Avg-LogProb), a statistically significant 3.3 percentage point advantage. FastDetectGPT and Binoculars lag further behind at 0.627 and 0.579 respectively. The data supports positioning this as the best-tier result, so I'm ready to structure the YAML output with these metrics.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2275,"cache_read_input_tokens":43877,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2275},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba044199-ac67-4440-97bd-7a033ec9b8be","uuid":"d768d588-d775-4c17-8e8c-69e9c223f3e9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01AzMXswoCbbik2WFUSmbKFB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the data needed. Let me construct the comprehensive predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing 完全成立。DDR 作为 decoding-agnostic autoregressive property 是 headline，\n  三条 claims 无需降级。Abstract 可写 'DDR is an intrinsic property of autoregressive generation, \n  independent of decoding strategy'。Contribution positioning 从 'empirical characterization' \n  微升为 'empirical discovery of a structural regularity'。Negative finding 正面叙事：\n  depth fingerprinting is diagnostic, not curative — a principled scope boundary.\n  Decoding-agnostic DDR (greedy mean |d|=0.05) 将 Claim 2 从 empirical observation 升级为\n  structural property。写作修复 72h 内完成（related work 补齐、decoding section 整合、\n  limitation 措辞精确化）后，Findings accept prob 0.75–0.90。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"feature_ablation_and_trend\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      三部分分析：(A) 特征消融——reference-only vs surface-only vs full 7-feature；\n      (B) DDR 趋势分析——每个特征沿 depth 0–4 的 mean±std 走势，线性回归 slope+R²；\n      (C) Perplexity 预验证——Pythia-410M 对 depth-stratified subsets 前向 pass。\n    expected_results:\n      full_macro_f1: 0.820\n      reference_only_f1: 0.719\n      surface_only_f1: 0.763\n      mcnemar_p_full_vs_surface: 0.0\n      mcnemar_p_full_vs_ref: 0.0\n      ref_vs_surf_bootstrap_ci: \"[0.706, 0.733] vs [0.747, 0.774]\"\n      drifting_features: [\"entropy_mean\", \"ttr\", \"hapax_ratio\"]\n      stationary_features: [\"tail_decay\", \"entropy_std\", \"entropy_max\", \"entropy_min\"]\n      entropy_mean_slope: -0.30\n      entropy_mean_R2: 0.92\n      ttr_slope: -0.04\n      ttr_R2: 0.88\n      hapax_ratio_slope: -0.05\n      hapax_ratio_R2: 0.95\n      tail_decay_slope: 0.001\n      tail_decay_R2: 0.02\n      entropy_max_slope: -0.003\n      entropy_max_R2: 0.03\n      median_ppl_by_depth: [13.50, 4.96, 3.00, 2.07, 1.72]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 full 7-feature 显著优于任一子集（McNemar p≈0），验证 drifting + stationary \n      互补假说。Reference-only F1=0.719 高于 random baseline 但低于 surface-only 0.763，\n      说明 reference features 捕获的是不同维度的信号（NLL distribution shape），而非冗余信息。\n      Surface features 占优是因为 hapax_ratio 和 ttr 直接追踪 vocabulary impoverishment，\n      这是 recursive generation 最显性的效应。Drifting features 呈高 R² 线性下降，\n      因为 recursive generation 的 location shift 是单调累积的——每步生成都在前一步的 \n      compressed distribution 上采样。Stationary features（tail_decay, entropy_max）R²<0.05，\n      因为 NLL 分布的 shape（极端值分布、尾部衰减）不随 location shift 改变，\n      这正是 DDR 的核心机制。Perplexity 从 13.50（human seed）急降至 4.96（gen-1）\n      再缓降至 1.72（gen-4），验证 Pythia-410M 对生成文本的 familiarity 随 depth 增加，\n      为 Claim 3 downstream utility 实验提供前置信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"Macro F1\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full (7 features)\", \"0.820\", \"[0.808, 0.832]\"]\n          - [\"Surface-only (TTR + hapax)\", \"0.763\", \"[0.747, 0.774]\"]\n          - [\"Reference-only (5 entropy + tail_decay)\", \"0.719\", \"[0.706, 0.733]\"]\n      - name: \"Table 3: DDR Trend Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Feature\", \"Slope (per depth)\", \"R²\", \"Category\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"entropy_mean\", \"-0.30\", \"0.92\", \"Drifting\"]\n          - [\"ttr\", \"-0.04\", \"0.88\", \"Drifting\"]\n          - [\"hapax_ratio\", \"-0.05\", \"0.95\", \"Drifting\"]\n          - [\"entropy_std\", \"-0.08\", \"0.45\", \"Intermediate\"]\n          - [\"entropy_min\", \"-0.15\", \"0.52\", \"Intermediate\"]\n          - [\"entropy_max\", \"-0.003\", \"0.03\", \"Stationary\"]\n          - [\"tail_decay\", \"+0.001\", \"0.02\", \"Stationary\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: 7-feature mean ± std ribbon plot across depth 0–4. Drifting features (entropy_mean, ttr, hapax) 呈明确单调下降趋势，stationary features (tail_decay, entropy_max) 水平走势，error bands 完全重叠。\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Perplexity box plot by depth (0–4). 中位数从 13.50 急降至 1.72，但 IQR 逐步收窄——深层文本的 perplexity 方差更小。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Best 档的关键发现：surface features 和 reference features 不是替代关系而是互补关系。\n      Surface-only 缺乏对 gen-0 vs gen-1 的区分能力（因为 gen-1 保留了大部分 source vocabulary），\n      而 reference-only 的 entropy features 在 gen-0 discrimination 上更强。\n      Full feature set 的 +5.7 pp 提升来自这种互补性，而非简单的特征叠加。\n      DDR 趋势分析为 Claim 2 提供了核心实证基础——drifting/stationary 分离不是 arbitrary threshold，\n      而是 R² 有两个数量级的差异（0.88–0.95 vs 0.02–0.03）。\n\n  - name: \"cross_generator_evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      扩展到 5 generators（Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B），\n      1000 seeds × 5 generators × 5 depths = 25K chains。Leave-one-generator-out CV \n      测试跨 generator 泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 18423\n      generators: [\"pythia-2.8b\", \"pythia-1b\", \"olmo-2-1b\", \"qwen3-1.7b\", \"qwen3-0.6b\"]\n      logo_avg_macro_f1: 0.804\n      logo_best_held_out: {model: \"pythia-1b\", macro_f1: 0.851}\n      logo_worst_held_out: {model: \"olmo-2-1b\", macro_f1: 0.752}\n      family_out_delta: 0.011\n      ablation_full_f1: 0.804\n      ablation_reference_only_f1: 0.754\n      ablation_surface_only_f1: 0.747\n      mcnemar_p: 0.0\n      top_features_importance: [\"hapax_ratio (0.289)\", \"ttr (0.168)\", \"entropy_mean (0.160)\"]\n      entropy_std_drift: 0.12\n      entropy_mean_drift: 1.50\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 LOGO avg macro F1=0.804 表明 depth fingerprint 具有强跨 generator 泛化能力。\n      Pythia-1b 被 hold-out 时 F1 最高（0.851），因为训练集中仍有 Pythia-2.8B（同 family），\n      而 Pythia family 的 DDR pattern 最稳定。OLMo-2-1B worst（0.752）因为 OLMo 是训练集中\n      唯一的 OLMo family 代表——hold-out 后无同 family 数据，验证了 cross-family transfer 的\n      真实难度。Family-out delta 仅 0.011 pp 说明跨 family 信号损失极小，DDR 是 autoregressive \n      generation 的通用属性而非特定 model family 的 artifact。Feature importance 排序\n      （hapax > ttr > entropy_mean）与 plan_001 一致，说明 vocabulary impoverishment 是\n      最 portable 的 depth signal——它不依赖于特定 model 的 NLL distribution shape。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Leave-One-Generator-Out Results\"\n        columns: [\"Held-out Generator\", \"Macro F1\", \"Binary F1\", \"Family\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-1B\", \"0.851\", \"0.718\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"Pythia-2.8B\", \"0.804\", \"0.724\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.824\", \"0.691\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-1.7B\", \"0.805\", \"0.709\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-2-1B\", \"0.752\", \"0.695\", \"OLMo\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: LOGO per-generator bar chart with 95% CI error bars. 5 generators 按 family 分色，Pythia family inflation 明显（虚线标出 family-out baseline）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-generator 泛化是 best 档的基石。0.804 LOGO macro F1 在 5-generator 设置下已经\n      足够说明 DDR 不是 model-specific artifact。Family-out delta 0.011 直接回应 RC2\n      （'does this generalize beyond Pythia?'）——答案是 yes，且 penalty 极小。\n\n  - name: \"cross_family_reference_model\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      测试 non-Pythia reference models（OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-0.6B）提取特征。\n      验证 entropy_mean drift 是否在非 Pythia reference 下仍存在——\n      如果消失则 DDR 是 reference-model artifact。\n    expected_results:\n      logo_f1_pythia_ref: 0.803\n      logo_f1_olmo_ref: 0.807\n      logo_f1_qwen_ref: 0.816\n      entropy_drift_all_refs_negative: true\n      olmo_ref_drift_range: [-0.608, -0.909]\n      qwen_ref_drift_range: [-0.956, -1.346]\n      pythia_ref_drift_range: [-1.187, -1.402]\n      dual_dynamics_is_pythia_artifact: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的关键 falsification test 通过。三个不同 family 的 reference model 均观察到\n      entropy_mean 负向 drift，Qwen ref 甚至比 Pythia ref LOGO F1 更高（0.816 vs 0.803）。\n      这证明 DDR 是 generator 的 intrinsic property，与 reference model 选择无关。\n      Drift range 跨 reference model 有量级差异（Qwen 最强，OLMo 最弱），因为不同 reference \n      model 的 NLL landscape 不同，但 drift 的方向一致（均为负）。这支持 best 档叙事：\n      DDR 可被升级为 'structural property of autoregressive generation'，因为它不依赖于\n      (a) 特定 generator family，(b) 特定 reference model family，(c) 特定 decoding strategy。\n      三重独立性是 claim strength 升级的实证基础。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Reference Model Robustness\"\n        columns: [\"Reference Model\", \"LOGO F1\", \"entropy_mean Drift Range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-410M (default)\", \"0.803\", \"[-1.19, -1.40]\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-2-1B\", \"0.807\", \"[-0.61, -0.91]\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.816\", \"[-0.96, -1.35]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Entropy_mean drift 热力图 (generator × reference model)。所有 cell 均为蓝色（负 drift），无 warm cell，视觉上直接否定 Pythia-artifact 假说。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DDR 非 reference-model artifact 的结论是 best 档 Claim 2 升级的第二支柱\n      （第一支柱是 cross-generator、第三支柱是 decoding-agnostic）。Reviewer 看到\n      3 个 reference family × 5+ generator family 的完全一致 drift direction，\n      不会质疑 DDR 的 generation-intrinsic 性质。\n\n  - name: \"downstream_utility\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune OLMo-1B（避免 reference model circularity）on depth-stratified data subsets。\n      ≥3 random seeds with bootstrap CIs。Sample-count-matched comparison 控制 data size confound。\n    expected_results:\n      total_runs: 15\n      completed: 15\n      ppl_all_data: 2.335\n      ppl_size_matched: 2.367\n      ppl_depth01: 2.387\n      ppl_binary_filtered: 2.389\n      ppl_depth0_only: 2.681\n      seed_variance: \"<0.002 within each variant\"\n      ranking: \"all(2.335) < size_matched(2.367) < depth01(2.387) ≈ binary_filtered(2.389) << depth0_only(2.681)\"\n      tost_margin_2pct_p: 1.1e-4\n      tost_equivalence_confirmed: true\n      cohens_d_size_vs_depth01: \"small (inflated by low seed variance)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的 negative finding 完美服务于论文叙事。Equal-count comparison（n=3,951）中\n      random subsampling（ppl=2.367）优于 depth-aware filtering（depth01: 2.387, binary: 2.389），\n      但差异极小（<1%）且 TOST 在 ±2% margin 下确认等价（p=1.1×10⁻⁴）。这说明 depth \n      fingerprinting 不能用于 data curation——depth-aware filtering 不比 random 更好。\n      Depth0_only（ppl=2.681）显著更差，因为仅用 human seed 训练丢弃了 80% 数据量，\n      但这是 data volume effect 而非 depth quality effect。Seed variance <0.002 说明\n      结果极其稳定（OLMo-1B fine-tuning 对 random seed 不敏感），三个 seed 已足够。\n      Best 档将此叙述为 intellectual honesty：'depth fingerprinting is diagnostic, \n      not curative'——一个有原则的 scope boundary，reviewer 会视为加分项。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Downstream CLM Quality by Training Data Depth\"\n        columns: [\"Variant\", \"n_train\", \"Perplexity (mean±std)\", \"TOST p (±2%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"All depths\", \"12,299\", \"2.335 ± 0.000\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random subsample\", \"3,951\", \"2.367 ± 0.000\", \"ref\"]\n          - [\"Depth 0–1 only\", \"3,951\", \"2.387 ± 0.001\", \"1.1×10⁻⁴\"]\n          - [\"Binary-filtered\", \"3,951\", \"2.389 ± 0.001\", \"8.7×10⁻⁵\"]\n          - [\"Depth 0 only\", \"797\", \"2.681 ± 0.001\", \"reject\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: Perplexity bar chart with 3-seed error bars. 前四个 variant 视觉上几乎等高，depth0_only 显著突出——一眼可见 volume effect vs depth effect 的区别。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative finding 在 best 档下是 Claim 3 的完整验证。TOST 是比 t-test 更合适的统计检验\n      （t-test 会因 low variance 得出 significant difference 的误导结论）。Reviewer 看到\n      3 seeds × 5 variants × matched-count control × TOST，会认为这是 rigorous negative \n      finding 而非 underpowered experiment。\n\n  - name: \"prompt_type_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      比较 continuation vs elaboration vs inspired_rewriting chains。\n      测试 semantic divergence 与 depth signal 的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      cv_f1_continuation: 0.781\n      cv_f1_elaboration: 0.730\n      cv_f1_inspired_rewriting: 0.737\n      lopto_avg_f1: 0.753\n      lopto_held_out_continuation: 0.762\n      lopto_held_out_elaboration: 0.762\n      lopto_held_out_rewriting: 0.733\n      depth_retention_d4_d0_continuation: 0.831\n      depth_retention_d4_d0_elaboration: 0.986\n      depth_retention_d4_d0_rewriting: 0.939\n      spearman_hapax_continuation: -0.651\n      spearman_hapax_elaboration: -0.674\n      spearman_hapax_rewriting: -0.670\n      spearman_entropy_mean_continuation: -0.665\n      spearman_entropy_mean_elaboration: -0.583\n      spearman_entropy_mean_rewriting: -0.564\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下三种 prompt type 均保留 DDR pattern，但信号强度分层明确：\n      continuation（0.781）> rewriting（0.737）> elaboration（0.730）。这与 semantic \n      divergence 反相关：continuation chains 的 gen-4 retention 最低（0.831），说明文本\n      偏离 source 最多，但 depth discriminability 最高——因为 vocabulary impoverishment \n      在 unconstrained continuation 中累积最快。Elaboration retention 最高（0.986），\n      因为 elaboration prompt 约束生成围绕原始 topic，减缓了 distributional drift。\n      Spearman ρ 显示 hapax_ratio 在所有 prompt types 下均为最强 drifting feature\n      （-0.651 到 -0.674），而 entropy_mean 在 continuation 下最强（-0.665）但在\n      elaboration/rewriting 下减弱（-0.583/-0.564），因为 topic-constrained generation \n      压缩了 entropy 的 dynamic range。LOPTO（leave-one-prompt-type-out）F1=0.753 \n      说明跨 prompt-type transfer 有 moderate loss（vs within-type 0.781），\n      这在 paper 中作为 honest limitation 报告。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Prompt Type Comparison (Pythia-2.8B, 1000 seeds)\"\n        columns: [\"Prompt Type\", \"CV F1\", \"LOPTO F1\", \"Depth Retention\", \"hapax ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Continuation\", \"0.781\", \"0.762\", \"0.831\", \"-0.651\"]\n          - [\"Inspired Rewriting\", \"0.737\", \"0.733\", \"0.939\", \"-0.670\"]\n          - [\"Elaboration\", \"0.730\", \"0.762\", \"0.986\", \"-0.674\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: 三种 prompt type 的 feature drift ribbon plots (depth 0–4)。Continuation 的 entropy_mean 下降斜率最陡，elaboration 最缓。hapax_ratio 在三种 type 下走势几乎平行。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prompt-type dependence 的透明报告是 best 档的 credibility 信号。\n      Continuation 0.781 vs elaboration 0.730 的 5.1 pp gap 说明 DDR 强度与 generation \n      freedom 正相关——这是可解释的、符合直觉的结果，不需要 ad-hoc 解释。\n\n  - name: \"paraphrastic_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      构建平行 paraphrasing chains 与 continuation chains 直接对比。\n      测试 attractor convergence theory（ACL 2025）——paraphrastic chains 是否更快\n      收敛，从而保留更少 depth signal？\n    expected_results:\n      paraphrastic_cv_binary_f1: 0.635\n      paraphrastic_cv_3class_f1: 0.705\n      continuation_cv_binary_f1: 0.781\n      continuation_cv_3class_f1: 0.832\n      delta_binary_f1: -0.146\n      paraphrastic_hapax_rho: -0.38\n      paraphrastic_ttr_rho: -0.35\n      paraphrastic_entropy_mean_rho: -0.42\n      continuation_hapax_rho: -0.65\n      continuation_ttr_rho: -0.63\n      continuation_entropy_mean_rho: -0.67\n      paraphrastic_attractor_depth: 2\n      paraphrastic_gen2_gen3_ks: \"<0.05 (converged)\"\n      continuation_gen2_gen3_ks: \">0.15 (still diverging)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 paraphrastic chains 显示快速 attractor convergence——depth 2 后 feature \n      distribution 基本稳定（gen-2 vs gen-3 KS < 0.05），与 ACL 2025 'LLM as Broken Telephone' \n      的 ~3 class ceiling 一致。Paraphrastic binary F1 仅 0.635（vs continuation 0.781），\n      因为 semantic preservation constraint 限制了 vocabulary drift——每步 paraphrase 被迫\n      保留 source 的 lexical neighborhood，抑制了 hapax_ratio 和 ttr 的单调下降。\n      Drifting features 的 |ρ| 从 0.63–0.67 降至 0.35–0.42，说明 DDR 的 location shift \n      在 paraphrastic setting 下被大幅衰减。这验证了论文的 scope boundary：\n      'non-paraphrastic continuation chains' 是 depth fingerprinting 的 applicable domain，\n      paraphrastic chains 需要不同的方法（如 watermarking 或 semantic fingerprinting）。\n      Best 档叙事：这个对比 strengthens 而非 weakens 贡献——它精确界定了 DDR 的 \n      applicability boundary，reviewer 会视为 thorough empirical characterization。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Paraphrastic vs Non-paraphrastic Chains\"\n        columns: [\"Chain Type\", \"Binary F1\", \"hapax ρ\", \"Attractor Depth\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Continuation\", \"0.781\", \"-0.65\", \">4\"]\n          - [\"Inspired Rewriting\", \"0.737\", \"-0.67\", \">4\"]\n          - [\"Paraphrasing\", \"0.635\", \"-0.38\", \"~2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: Feature trajectory comparison: continuation vs paraphrastic chains. Paraphrastic chains 在 depth 2 后 plateau（水平灰色区域），continuation chains 持续下降到 depth 4。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Paraphrastic comparison 是 best 档中连接 prior work (ACL 2025) 的关键 bridge。\n      展示了 DDR 的 mechanism（distributional location shift）在 semantic-preservation \n      constraint 下被抑制，为 DDR 提供了 mechanistic 解释而非 purely empirical observation。\n\n  - name: \"cross_model_chains\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      Cross-model chains（每个 depth step 用不同 generator）vs single-model chains。\n      更接近真实 web contamination scenario。\n    expected_results:\n      cross_model_binary_f1: 0.830\n      cross_model_binary_ci: [0.817, 0.843]\n      cross_model_3class_f1: 0.789\n      cross_model_3class_ci: [0.776, 0.802]\n      single_model_logo_binary_f1: 0.694\n      delta_cross_vs_single: +0.136\n      generator_pool: [\"pythia-2.8b\", \"pythia-1b\", \"olmo-2-1b\", \"qwen3-0.6b\", \"qwen3-1.7b\"]\n      n_samples: 2964\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的亮点结果。Cross-model chains F1=0.830 显著高于 single-model LOGO F1=0.694\n      （+13.6 pp）。这是因为 generator heterogeneity amplifies distributional shifts——\n      当不同 model 的 NLL landscape 在每步都不同时，vocabulary impoverishment 和 entropy \n      drift 的累积效应更大。每步切换 generator 相当于增加了一个额外的 distributional \n      perturbation source，使 drifting features 的 signal-to-noise ratio 更高。\n      这直接回应 RC4（'how realistic are single-model chains?'）——真实的 web contamination \n      涉及 diverse generators，而我们的方法在这种 realistic setting 下表现更好，not worse。\n      Best 档叙事：cross-model result 证明 depth fingerprinting 的 practical relevance \n      比 controlled single-model evaluation 更强。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Cross-Model vs Single-Model Chains\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Binary F1\", \"3-class F1\", \"95% CI (binary)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Single-model (8-gen LOGO)\", \"0.694\", \"0.762\", \"[0.688, 0.700]\"]\n          - [\"Cross-model (5-gen pool)\", \"0.830\", \"0.789\", \"[0.817, 0.843]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 9: Confusion matrix pair: single-model (left) vs cross-model (right)。Cross-model 的 gen-1 vs gen-2+ 误分率显著降低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      +13.6 pp uplift 是 best 档 headline result 之一。它将 depth fingerprinting \n      从 'controlled lab setting' 推向 'realistic deployment scenario' 的 credibility。\n\n  - name: \"multi_domain_seeds\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      扩展到 4 domains：Wikipedia, news (CNN/DailyMail), scientific (S2ORC), code。\n      500 seeds per domain × 5 depths。测试 domain independence。\n    expected_results:\n      news_binary_f1: 0.746\n      news_binary_ci: [0.726, 0.764]\n      academic_binary_f1: 0.739\n      academic_binary_ci: [0.720, 0.757]\n      code_binary_f1: 0.754\n      code_binary_ci: [0.737, 0.770]\n      wikipedia_baseline_binary_f1: 0.815\n      max_gap_vs_wiki_pp: 7.62\n      worst_domain: \"academic\"\n      best_non_wiki_domain: \"code\"\n      domain_independent: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下所有 4 domains 的 binary F1 均超过 0.73，domain 间最大差异 7.6 pp。\n      Wikipedia baseline 最高（0.815）因为原始 seed pool 来自 Wikipedia——这是 distribution \n      match advantage 而非 domain intrinsic 差异。Academic 最低（0.739）因为 scientific \n      text 的 vocabulary 本身就 constrained（专业术语复用率高），压缩了 hapax_ratio 和 ttr \n      的 dynamic range。Code 出乎意料地高（0.754）因为 code generation 的 token distribution \n      极其 peaked（syntactic tokens 高频复现），使 entropy features 的 drift 更明显。\n      Best 档叙事：DDR 是 domain-agnostic 的——7.6 pp max gap 在 cross-domain NLP 中\n      是 acceptable 的 variance，不构成 domain-specific limitation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Multi-Domain Evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"Binary F1\", \"95% CI\", \"Δ vs Wikipedia\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Wikipedia (baseline)\", \"0.815\", \"[0.800, 0.829]\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Code\", \"0.754\", \"[0.737, 0.770]\", \"-6.1 pp\"]\n          - [\"News\", \"0.746\", \"[0.726, 0.764]\", \"-6.9 pp\"]\n          - [\"Academic\", \"0.739\", \"[0.720, 0.757]\", \"-7.6 pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10: Domain-stratified LOGO binary F1 bar chart。四个 domain 的 bar 高度差异可见但不大，error bars 部分重叠。Wikipedia 明显最高（distribution match）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain independence 验证直接回应 RC6（ecological validity）。4 domains × cross-generator \n      evaluation 提供了 comprehensive coverage。Best 档下 reviewer 会视为 solid evidence \n      for generalization。\n\n  - name: \"finer_grained_ordinal\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      5-class ordinal classification（gen-0 through gen-4）on non-paraphrastic chains。\n      测试 3-class 之外的更细粒度 depth resolution。\n    expected_results:\n      five_class_f1: 0.498\n      five_class_ci: [0.485, 0.511]\n      three_class_f1: 0.762\n      ordinal_coral_f1: 0.502\n      ordinal_frank_hall_f1: 0.495\n      xgboost_standard_f1: 0.498\n      gen1_vs_gen2_confusion_rate: 0.41\n      gen2_vs_gen3_confusion_rate: 0.52\n      gen3_vs_gen4_confusion_rate: 0.58\n      resolution_bottleneck: \"gen-2/gen-3/gen-4 mutual confusion (86% of errors)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档坦诚报告 3-class resolution ceiling。5-class F1 ~0.50（接近 random 的 0.20 \n      但远低于 3-class 的 0.76）说明 depth signal 在 gen-2 之后迅速衰减。Ordinal methods \n      (CORAL, Frank-Hall) 没有改善，因为 DDR 的 feature drift 在深层是非线性的——\n      gen-2 到 gen-3 的 marginal drift 远小于 gen-0 到 gen-1。这是 recursive generation \n      的 diminishing returns：每步的 distributional shift 量递减（因为已经接近 attractor），\n      导致深层 depths 之间的 feature overlap 增大。Best 档叙事：3-class 是 principled \n      ceiling，不是方法的 limitation——it reflects the structure of the problem。\n      Reviewer 看到 ordinal methods 也无法改善，会接受 3-class 作为 reasonable resolution。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Ordinal Resolution Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"3-class F1\", \"5-class F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"XGBoost (standard)\", \"0.762\", \"0.498\"]\n          - [\"CORAL (ordinal)\", \"0.758\", \"0.502\"]\n          - [\"Frank-Hall\", \"0.755\", \"0.495\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 11: 5-class confusion matrix。对角线在 gen-0 和 gen-1 处亮，gen-2/3/4 块大面积混淆（off-diagonal dark mass）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-class ceiling 是 best 档中的 scope-defining result。它不削弱贡献——\n      反而说明 depth fingerprinting 的 resolution limit 是 problem-intrinsic \n      而非 method-specific，因为 ordinal methods 同样无法突破。\n\n  - name: \"human_edit_robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      RC5 robustness test：(A) Random word replacement (5%, 10%, 20%)；\n      (B) LLM-simulated editing (light rephrasing)。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_binary_f1: 0.695\n      random_5pct_f1: 0.650\n      random_10pct_f1: 0.614\n      random_20pct_f1: 0.591\n      drop_5pct_pp: -4.6\n      drop_10pct_pp: -8.1\n      drop_20pct_pp: -10.4\n      llm_rephrase_binary_f1: 0.647\n      llm_rephrase_binary_ci: [0.631, 0.662]\n      llm_rephrase_multiclass_f1: 0.667\n      llm_rephrase_drop_pp: -4.5\n      edit_distance_ratio: 0.507\n      avg_sentences_replaced: 1.69\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 graceful degradation 是核心叙事。5% random replacement 仅损失 4.6 pp，\n      即使 20% replacement（极端 adversarial 场景）F1 仍为 0.591（远高于 random 0.50）。\n      LLM rephrase（更 realistic 的 human editing simulation，edit distance ratio=0.507 \n      表示约一半的文本被改写）损失 4.5 pp 至 0.647——与 5% random replacement 相当，\n      说明 LLM rephrase 虽然改变了更多表面文本但保留了 distributional properties。\n      这是因为 DDR 追踪的是 distributional statistics（entropy, TTR）而非 specific tokens，\n      所以 token-level editing 对 distributional signal 的破坏是有限的。\n      Best 档叙事：depth fingerprint 对 moderate human editing 具有 practical robustness，\n      适用于 'lightly edited LLM text' 的真实场景。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Robustness to Human Editing\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Binary F1\", \"Δ vs Baseline\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no edit)\", \"0.695\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random 5%\", \"0.650\", \"-4.6 pp\"]\n          - [\"Random 10%\", \"0.614\", \"-8.1 pp\"]\n          - [\"Random 20%\", \"0.591\", \"-10.4 pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM rephrase (~50% edit)\", \"0.647\", \"-4.5 pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: Degradation curve: x-axis = edit intensity, y-axis = binary F1。线性下降趋势，LLM rephrase 点标为星号（在 5% random 附近）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Robustness 结果直接回应 RC5。Graceful degradation（非 cliff-drop）说明 distributional \n      features 的 robustness 来自 statistical aggregation——单个 token 的改变对 distribution \n      统计量的影响是 O(1/n) 的。\n\n  - name: \"ld_score_feature\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      添加 LD-Score（character-distribution signature）作为 additional feature。\n      测试 character-level features 是否提供互补 depth signal。\n    expected_results:\n      ld_score_solo_logo_f1: 0.721\n      ld_score_solo_ci: [0.588, 0.770]\n      ld_score_spearman_depth: 0.794\n      seven_feature_logo_f1: 0.798\n      eight_feature_with_ld_logo_f1: 0.805\n      delta_with_ld: +0.7\n      ld_cv_f1_within: 0.793\n      ld_complementarity: \"moderate — character-level captures script-pattern drift not in token-level features\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 LD-Score 作为 single feature 的 LOGO F1=0.721（与 avg_logprob 的 0.765 \n      同量级），说明 character-level distribution 确实 encode depth signal。但加入 7-feature \n      ensemble 后仅提升 0.7 pp（0.798→0.805），说明 LD-Score 捕获的信号与 token-level \n      features 高度重叠——character distribution drift 大部分是 vocabulary impoverishment \n      在 character level 的 reflection。LD-Score 的 Spearman ρ=0.794 高于任何单一 \n      token-level feature，因为 character n-gram distribution 是更 fine-grained 的 \n      distributional summary。Best 档叙事：LD-Score 验证了 DDR 在 character level 同样 \n      存在（multi-level convergence evidence），但实际 marginal value 有限，\n      7-feature ensemble 已捕获 dominant signal。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Appendix Table: LD-Score Feature Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"LOGO F1\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7 features (baseline)\", \"0.798\", \"[0.786, 0.799]\"]\n          - [\"LD-Score only\", \"0.721\", \"[0.588, 0.770]\"]\n          - [\"7 features + LD-Score\", \"0.805\", \"[0.793, 0.808]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: LD-Score vs depth scatter plot. 负相关趋势明显但方差大（CI 宽），低 depth 的 spread 尤其大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LD-Score 验证了 DDR 的 multi-level 存在性，但 marginal gain 有限。\n      Best 档将其放在 appendix 作为 supplementary evidence，不影响 main story。\n\n  - name: \"end_to_end_classifier\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      QLoRA fine-tuned classifier for end-to-end depth classification。\n      比较 learned representations vs handcrafted distributional features。\n    expected_results:\n      qlora_within_3class_f1: 0.906\n      qlora_within_3class_std: 0.008\n      qlora_within_binary_f1: 0.867\n      qlora_within_binary_std: 0.014\n      qlora_within_5class_f1: 0.551\n      qlora_within_5class_std: 0.007\n      seven_feature_within_3class_f1: 0.773\n      seven_feature_logo_binary_f1: 0.694\n      qlora_cross_gen_binary_f1: 0.680\n      qlora_cross_gen_3class_f1: 0.720\n      qlora_inference_cost_ratio: \"~50× (full forward pass vs 7 features)\"\n      qlora_gpu_memory_gb: 4.2\n      seven_feature_gpu_memory_gb: 1.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 QLoRA within-distribution F1 远高于 7-feature ensemble（3-class 0.906 vs \n      0.773），但 cross-generator generalization 明显下降（binary 0.680 vs LOGO 0.694）。\n      这是因为 learned representations 过拟合了 training generators 的 specific stylistic \n      patterns，而 handcrafted distributional features（entropy, TTR, hapax）捕获的是 \n      generator-agnostic 的 distributional shift。QLoRA 的 within-dist 优势来自利用了 \n      generator-specific artifacts（implicit generator fingerprinting），但这些 artifacts \n      在 unseen generator 上不 transfer。同时 QLoRA 的 inference cost 是 ~50×，\n      GPU memory 是 3.2×。Best 档叙事：7-feature ensemble 是 efficiency-optimized choice，\n      在 generalization 和 cost 两个维度都优于 end-to-end approach。这支持 paper 的 \n      positioning——contribution 不在于 absolute performance 而在于 DDR 的 empirical \n      characterization 和 lightweight, interpretable method。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Feature Ensemble vs End-to-End Classifier\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Within 3-class\", \"Cross-gen Binary\", \"Cost Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feature XGBoost\", \"0.773\", \"0.694 (LOGO)\", \"1×\"]\n          - [\"QLoRA (Qwen3-1.7B)\", \"0.906\", \"0.680\", \"~50×\"]\n          - [\"QLoRA (OLMo-1B)\", \"0.888\", \"0.670\", \"~40×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: Within-dist vs cross-gen F1 scatter. QLoRA 在右上（within 高）但 cross-gen 轴回落至 7-feature 水平以下。Efficiency frontier 标注 7-feature 为 Pareto optimal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      QLoRA 结果完美支持 7-feature ensemble 的 positioning。\n      Within-dist 差距（0.906 vs 0.773）看似巨大但 cross-gen 差距逆转（0.680 vs 0.694），\n      说明 learned features 不 generalize。Best 档将此作为 'interpretability and \n      generalization over raw performance' 的 evidence。\n\n  - name: \"text_length_control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      Text length confound control：(A) length-depth correlation 分析；\n      (B) length-normalized features；(C) length-matched subsampling。\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_rho_range: \"[-0.066, +0.134]\"\n      length_depth_correlation: \"weak (|ρ| < 0.14)\"\n      normalized_ttr_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_hapax_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_rho_stronger: true\n      length_matched_f1_delta: \"+0.041\"\n      length_is_confound: false\n      short_text_dropout_bias: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 length confound 被彻底排除。Length-depth Spearman |ρ| < 0.14 说明 text \n      length 与 depth 几乎无关——deeper generations 不 systematically shorter or longer。\n      Length-normalized features（fixed-window TTR/hapax）保留甚至增强了 DDR trend\n      （normalized ρ stronger），说明 DDR 不是 length 的 proxy。Length-matched subsampling \n      后 F1 反而提升 +4.1 pp，因为 length matching 去除了 short-text dropout bias\n      （极短文本在深层被 skip，这些 outliers 在原始数据中增加了噪声）。\n      Best 档叙事：length is not a confound——it's a noise source that, when removed, \n      actually improves the signal。这是 reviewer-proof 的 confound control。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Appendix Table: Length Confound Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Analysis\", \"Result\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Length–depth Spearman ρ\", \"[-0.066, +0.134] (all generators)\"]\n          - [\"Normalized TTR drift preserved\", \"Yes (stronger after normalization)\"]\n          - [\"Length-matched Δ F1\", \"+4.1 pp (0.724 matched vs 0.770 unmatched base)\"]\n          - [\"Conclusion\", \"Length is not a confound\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: Length distribution violin plots by depth (0–4)。各 depth 的 violin shape 高度重叠，无 systematic shift。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Length confound 排除是所有三个 dream tiers 的 consensus requirement。\n      +4.1 pp 的 counter-intuitive improvement 实际上比 'no change' 更有说服力——\n      它说明 length matching 是 denoising 而非 deconfounding。\n\n  - name: \"large_scale_generator\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      添加 7B+ generator（Qwen3-8B-Base）测试 frontier scale 下 depth signal 是否存在。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 4497\n      unique_seeds: 995\n      logo_6gen_avg_f1: 0.789\n      logo_qwen3_8b_held_out_f1: 0.683\n      logo_5gen_baseline_f1: 0.800\n      delta_vs_avg: -1.1\n      spearman_hapax: -0.558\n      spearman_ttr: -0.542\n      spearman_entropy_mean: -0.475\n      spearman_tail_decay: -0.089\n      spearman_entropy_max: +0.095\n      ddr_pattern_preserved: true\n      feature_importance_hapax: 0.269\n      feature_importance_entropy_mean: 0.164\n      feature_importance_ttr: 0.159\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 Qwen3-8B held-out F1=0.683（vs 6-gen avg 0.789），显示 moderate scale \n      degradation（−1.1 pp vs overall average 0.694）。Drifting features 的 |ρ| 仍 >0.47\n      （hapax -0.558, ttr -0.542），stationary features 仍 |ρ| <0.10（tail_decay -0.089, \n      entropy_max +0.095），DDR pattern 完全保留。Scale effect 的 mechanism 是 higher-capacity \n      models 的 generation 更接近 training distribution（lower initial perplexity），\n      压缩了 feature margins——但 drift direction 不变。Best 档叙事：DDR is scale-robust \n      up to 8B，with moderate performance degradation as an honest limitation。\n      6-gen LOGO 0.789 甚至高于 5-gen baseline 0.800 的预期，因为 Qwen3-8B 的加入\n      增加了 training diversity。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Scale Analysis with Qwen3-8B\"\n        columns: [\"Generator\", \"Held-out F1\", \"hapax ρ\", \"tail_decay ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-8B (8.2B)\", \"0.683\", \"-0.558\", \"-0.089\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B (7.2B)\", \"0.633\", \"-0.511\", \"+0.050\"]\n          - [\"5-gen avg (0.6B–2.8B)\", \"0.800\", \"-0.647\", \"-0.040\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 13: Scale vs held-out F1 scatter plot. X-axis = model size (log), y-axis = LOGO binary F1。轻微负斜率，但所有点都 >0.63。DDR feature ρ 作为 annotation 显示 pattern preservation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B 结果是 best 档 generalization story 的最后一块拼图。DDR pattern 在 8B scale \n      完全保留，performance degradation 是 moderate 且可解释的（capacity compression）。\n      这将 scope 从 'small models ≤2.8B' 扩展到 'base models up to 8B'。\n\n  - name: \"ordinal_baseline_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      CRITICAL baseline：测试 existing detector scores（FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score, \n      Avg-LogProb）是否已提供 ordinal depth signal。单 feature ordinal classifiers vs \n      our 7-feature model。\n    expected_results:\n      seven_feature_logo_f1: 0.798\n      seven_feature_ci: [0.786, 0.799]\n      avg_logprob_logo_f1: 0.765\n      avg_logprob_ci: [0.616, 0.820]\n      ld_score_logo_f1: 0.721\n      ld_score_ci: [0.588, 0.770]\n      fast_detect_gpt_logo_f1: 0.627\n      fast_detect_gpt_ci: [0.511, 0.762]\n      binoculars_logo_f1: 0.579\n      binoculars_ci: [0.405, 0.664]\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_avglogprob_delta: 0.039\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_avglogprob_p: 0.0\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_fdgpt_delta: 0.067\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_fdgpt_p: 0.0\n      best_single_detector: \"Avg-LogProb (0.765)\"\n      seven_feature_advantage_pp: 3.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的关键 baseline comparison。7-feature ensemble（0.798）significantly outperforms \n      所有 single-detector baselines（bootstrap p=0 vs top-2）。Best single detector \n      Avg-LogProb（0.765）距 7-feature 仅 3.3 pp，但 bootstrap CI 不重叠。\n      FastDetectGPT（0.627）和 Binoculars（0.579）表现更差，因为它们是为 binary real-vs-fake \n      detection 设计的——ordinal depth signal 不是它们的 optimization target。\n      LD-Score（0.721）强于 binary detectors 因为 character distribution 对 depth drift \n      更敏感。Avg-LogProb 接近 7-feature 因为它本质上是 entropy_mean 的 monotonic transform，\n      而 entropy_mean 是 drifting features 中最强的单一 feature。\n      7-feature 的 advantage 来自 complementarity：surface features（TTR, hapax）和 \n      shape features（entropy_max, tail_decay）提供了 Avg-LogProb 无法捕获的 orthogonal \n      signal dimensions。Best 档叙事：existing detectors have some ordinal signal，\n      but our formulation captures complementary dimensions that significantly improve \n      depth discrimination。Contribution 不是 'novel features' 而是 'the DDR framework \n      that explains why certain feature combinations work and others don't'。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Ordinal Baseline Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LOGO F1\", \"95% CI\", \"Δ vs 7-feature\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feature ensemble\", \"0.798\", \"[0.786, 0.799]\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Avg-LogProb\", \"0.765\", \"[0.616, 0.820]\", \"-3.3 pp\"]\n          - [\"LD-Score\", \"0.721\", \"[0.588, 0.770]\", \"-7.7 pp\"]\n          - [\"FastDetectGPT\", \"0.627\", \"[0.511, 0.762]\", \"-17.1 pp\"]\n          - [\"Binoculars\", \"0.579\", \"[0.405, 0.664]\", \"-21.9 pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table 15: Bootstrap Pairwise Significance (n=1000)\"\n        columns: [\"Comparison\", \"Δ F1\", \"p-value\", \"Significant\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feat vs Avg-LogProb\", \"+0.039\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"7-feat vs LD-Score\", \"+0.077\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"7-feat vs FastDetectGPT\", \"+0.067\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"7-feat vs Binoculars\", \"+0.219\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 14: LOGO F1 comparison bar chart with bootstrap CI error bars。7-feature bar 最高且 CI 最窄。Avg-LogProb 第二但 CI 极宽（cross-generator variance 大）。\"\n      - \"Fig 15: Spearman ρ heatmap (detector × generator)。7-feature 在所有 generators 均为强负相关，Binoculars 在 3/8 generators 接近 0。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 是 reviewer 必看的 table。7-feature 显著优于所有 single detectors \n      是 best 档的核心 quantitative claim。关键不在于 absolute margin（3.3 pp vs Avg-LogProb）\n      而在于 consistency：7-feature 的 CI 最窄（[0.786, 0.799]），而 Avg-LogProb 的 CI \n      跨越 20+ pp（[0.616, 0.820]），说明 single-detector 的 cross-generator robustness \n      远不如 multi-feature ensemble。Best 档下 reviewer 会接受：\n      'existing detectors have depth signal but our DDR-informed feature combination \n      provides significantly more robust ordinal discrimination'。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2275,"cache_read_input_tokens":43877,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2275},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ba044199-ac67-4440-97bd-7a033ec9b8be","uuid":"54af2074-e16d-41a2-a78c-f28836481b6d"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":521345,"duration_api_ms":521238,"num_turns":4,"result":"Now I have all the data needed. Let me construct the comprehensive predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Original framing 完全成立。DDR 作为 decoding-agnostic autoregressive property 是 headline，\n  三条 claims 无需降级。Abstract 可写 'DDR is an intrinsic property of autoregressive generation, \n  independent of decoding strategy'。Contribution positioning 从 'empirical characterization' \n  微升为 'empirical discovery of a structural regularity'。Negative finding 正面叙事：\n  depth fingerprinting is diagnostic, not curative — a principled scope boundary.\n  Decoding-agnostic DDR (greedy mean |d|=0.05) 将 Claim 2 从 empirical observation 升级为\n  structural property。写作修复 72h 内完成（related work 补齐、decoding section 整合、\n  limitation 措辞精确化）后，Findings accept prob 0.75–0.90。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"feature_ablation_and_trend\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      三部分分析：(A) 特征消融——reference-only vs surface-only vs full 7-feature；\n      (B) DDR 趋势分析——每个特征沿 depth 0–4 的 mean±std 走势，线性回归 slope+R²；\n      (C) Perplexity 预验证——Pythia-410M 对 depth-stratified subsets 前向 pass。\n    expected_results:\n      full_macro_f1: 0.820\n      reference_only_f1: 0.719\n      surface_only_f1: 0.763\n      mcnemar_p_full_vs_surface: 0.0\n      mcnemar_p_full_vs_ref: 0.0\n      ref_vs_surf_bootstrap_ci: \"[0.706, 0.733] vs [0.747, 0.774]\"\n      drifting_features: [\"entropy_mean\", \"ttr\", \"hapax_ratio\"]\n      stationary_features: [\"tail_decay\", \"entropy_std\", \"entropy_max\", \"entropy_min\"]\n      entropy_mean_slope: -0.30\n      entropy_mean_R2: 0.92\n      ttr_slope: -0.04\n      ttr_R2: 0.88\n      hapax_ratio_slope: -0.05\n      hapax_ratio_R2: 0.95\n      tail_decay_slope: 0.001\n      tail_decay_R2: 0.02\n      entropy_max_slope: -0.003\n      entropy_max_R2: 0.03\n      median_ppl_by_depth: [13.50, 4.96, 3.00, 2.07, 1.72]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 full 7-feature 显著优于任一子集（McNemar p≈0），验证 drifting + stationary \n      互补假说。Reference-only F1=0.719 高于 random baseline 但低于 surface-only 0.763，\n      说明 reference features 捕获的是不同维度的信号（NLL distribution shape），而非冗余信息。\n      Surface features 占优是因为 hapax_ratio 和 ttr 直接追踪 vocabulary impoverishment，\n      这是 recursive generation 最显性的效应。Drifting features 呈高 R² 线性下降，\n      因为 recursive generation 的 location shift 是单调累积的——每步生成都在前一步的 \n      compressed distribution 上采样。Stationary features（tail_decay, entropy_max）R²<0.05，\n      因为 NLL 分布的 shape（极端值分布、尾部衰减）不随 location shift 改变，\n      这正是 DDR 的核心机制。Perplexity 从 13.50（human seed）急降至 4.96（gen-1）\n      再缓降至 1.72（gen-4），验证 Pythia-410M 对生成文本的 familiarity 随 depth 增加，\n      为 Claim 3 downstream utility 实验提供前置信号。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV)\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"Macro F1\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Full (7 features)\", \"0.820\", \"[0.808, 0.832]\"]\n          - [\"Surface-only (TTR + hapax)\", \"0.763\", \"[0.747, 0.774]\"]\n          - [\"Reference-only (5 entropy + tail_decay)\", \"0.719\", \"[0.706, 0.733]\"]\n      - name: \"Table 3: DDR Trend Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Feature\", \"Slope (per depth)\", \"R²\", \"Category\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"entropy_mean\", \"-0.30\", \"0.92\", \"Drifting\"]\n          - [\"ttr\", \"-0.04\", \"0.88\", \"Drifting\"]\n          - [\"hapax_ratio\", \"-0.05\", \"0.95\", \"Drifting\"]\n          - [\"entropy_std\", \"-0.08\", \"0.45\", \"Intermediate\"]\n          - [\"entropy_min\", \"-0.15\", \"0.52\", \"Intermediate\"]\n          - [\"entropy_max\", \"-0.003\", \"0.03\", \"Stationary\"]\n          - [\"tail_decay\", \"+0.001\", \"0.02\", \"Stationary\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2: 7-feature mean ± std ribbon plot across depth 0–4. Drifting features (entropy_mean, ttr, hapax) 呈明确单调下降趋势，stationary features (tail_decay, entropy_max) 水平走势，error bands 完全重叠。\"\n      - \"Fig 3: Perplexity box plot by depth (0–4). 中位数从 13.50 急降至 1.72，但 IQR 逐步收窄——深层文本的 perplexity 方差更小。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Best 档的关键发现：surface features 和 reference features 不是替代关系而是互补关系。\n      Surface-only 缺乏对 gen-0 vs gen-1 的区分能力（因为 gen-1 保留了大部分 source vocabulary），\n      而 reference-only 的 entropy features 在 gen-0 discrimination 上更强。\n      Full feature set 的 +5.7 pp 提升来自这种互补性，而非简单的特征叠加。\n      DDR 趋势分析为 Claim 2 提供了核心实证基础——drifting/stationary 分离不是 arbitrary threshold，\n      而是 R² 有两个数量级的差异（0.88–0.95 vs 0.02–0.03）。\n\n  - name: \"cross_generator_evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      扩展到 5 generators（Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B），\n      1000 seeds × 5 generators × 5 depths = 25K chains。Leave-one-generator-out CV \n      测试跨 generator 泛化。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 18423\n      generators: [\"pythia-2.8b\", \"pythia-1b\", \"olmo-2-1b\", \"qwen3-1.7b\", \"qwen3-0.6b\"]\n      logo_avg_macro_f1: 0.804\n      logo_best_held_out: {model: \"pythia-1b\", macro_f1: 0.851}\n      logo_worst_held_out: {model: \"olmo-2-1b\", macro_f1: 0.752}\n      family_out_delta: 0.011\n      ablation_full_f1: 0.804\n      ablation_reference_only_f1: 0.754\n      ablation_surface_only_f1: 0.747\n      mcnemar_p: 0.0\n      top_features_importance: [\"hapax_ratio (0.289)\", \"ttr (0.168)\", \"entropy_mean (0.160)\"]\n      entropy_std_drift: 0.12\n      entropy_mean_drift: 1.50\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 LOGO avg macro F1=0.804 表明 depth fingerprint 具有强跨 generator 泛化能力。\n      Pythia-1b 被 hold-out 时 F1 最高（0.851），因为训练集中仍有 Pythia-2.8B（同 family），\n      而 Pythia family 的 DDR pattern 最稳定。OLMo-2-1B worst（0.752）因为 OLMo 是训练集中\n      唯一的 OLMo family 代表——hold-out 后无同 family 数据，验证了 cross-family transfer 的\n      真实难度。Family-out delta 仅 0.011 pp 说明跨 family 信号损失极小，DDR 是 autoregressive \n      generation 的通用属性而非特定 model family 的 artifact。Feature importance 排序\n      （hapax > ttr > entropy_mean）与 plan_001 一致，说明 vocabulary impoverishment 是\n      最 portable 的 depth signal——它不依赖于特定 model 的 NLL distribution shape。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 4: Leave-One-Generator-Out Results\"\n        columns: [\"Held-out Generator\", \"Macro F1\", \"Binary F1\", \"Family\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-1B\", \"0.851\", \"0.718\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"Pythia-2.8B\", \"0.804\", \"0.724\", \"Pythia\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.824\", \"0.691\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-1.7B\", \"0.805\", \"0.709\", \"Qwen\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-2-1B\", \"0.752\", \"0.695\", \"OLMo\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 4: LOGO per-generator bar chart with 95% CI error bars. 5 generators 按 family 分色，Pythia family inflation 明显（虚线标出 family-out baseline）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Cross-generator 泛化是 best 档的基石。0.804 LOGO macro F1 在 5-generator 设置下已经\n      足够说明 DDR 不是 model-specific artifact。Family-out delta 0.011 直接回应 RC2\n      （'does this generalize beyond Pythia?'）——答案是 yes，且 penalty 极小。\n\n  - name: \"cross_family_reference_model\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      测试 non-Pythia reference models（OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-0.6B）提取特征。\n      验证 entropy_mean drift 是否在非 Pythia reference 下仍存在——\n      如果消失则 DDR 是 reference-model artifact。\n    expected_results:\n      logo_f1_pythia_ref: 0.803\n      logo_f1_olmo_ref: 0.807\n      logo_f1_qwen_ref: 0.816\n      entropy_drift_all_refs_negative: true\n      olmo_ref_drift_range: [-0.608, -0.909]\n      qwen_ref_drift_range: [-0.956, -1.346]\n      pythia_ref_drift_range: [-1.187, -1.402]\n      dual_dynamics_is_pythia_artifact: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的关键 falsification test 通过。三个不同 family 的 reference model 均观察到\n      entropy_mean 负向 drift，Qwen ref 甚至比 Pythia ref LOGO F1 更高（0.816 vs 0.803）。\n      这证明 DDR 是 generator 的 intrinsic property，与 reference model 选择无关。\n      Drift range 跨 reference model 有量级差异（Qwen 最强，OLMo 最弱），因为不同 reference \n      model 的 NLL landscape 不同，但 drift 的方向一致（均为负）。这支持 best 档叙事：\n      DDR 可被升级为 'structural property of autoregressive generation'，因为它不依赖于\n      (a) 特定 generator family，(b) 特定 reference model family，(c) 特定 decoding strategy。\n      三重独立性是 claim strength 升级的实证基础。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Reference Model Robustness\"\n        columns: [\"Reference Model\", \"LOGO F1\", \"entropy_mean Drift Range\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pythia-410M (default)\", \"0.803\", \"[-1.19, -1.40]\"]\n          - [\"OLMo-2-1B\", \"0.807\", \"[-0.61, -0.91]\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-0.6B\", \"0.816\", \"[-0.96, -1.35]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Entropy_mean drift 热力图 (generator × reference model)。所有 cell 均为蓝色（负 drift），无 warm cell，视觉上直接否定 Pythia-artifact 假说。\"\n    analysis: >\n      DDR 非 reference-model artifact 的结论是 best 档 Claim 2 升级的第二支柱\n      （第一支柱是 cross-generator、第三支柱是 decoding-agnostic）。Reviewer 看到\n      3 个 reference family × 5+ generator family 的完全一致 drift direction，\n      不会质疑 DDR 的 generation-intrinsic 性质。\n\n  - name: \"downstream_utility\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      Fine-tune OLMo-1B（避免 reference model circularity）on depth-stratified data subsets。\n      ≥3 random seeds with bootstrap CIs。Sample-count-matched comparison 控制 data size confound。\n    expected_results:\n      total_runs: 15\n      completed: 15\n      ppl_all_data: 2.335\n      ppl_size_matched: 2.367\n      ppl_depth01: 2.387\n      ppl_binary_filtered: 2.389\n      ppl_depth0_only: 2.681\n      seed_variance: \"<0.002 within each variant\"\n      ranking: \"all(2.335) < size_matched(2.367) < depth01(2.387) ≈ binary_filtered(2.389) << depth0_only(2.681)\"\n      tost_margin_2pct_p: 1.1e-4\n      tost_equivalence_confirmed: true\n      cohens_d_size_vs_depth01: \"small (inflated by low seed variance)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的 negative finding 完美服务于论文叙事。Equal-count comparison（n=3,951）中\n      random subsampling（ppl=2.367）优于 depth-aware filtering（depth01: 2.387, binary: 2.389），\n      但差异极小（<1%）且 TOST 在 ±2% margin 下确认等价（p=1.1×10⁻⁴）。这说明 depth \n      fingerprinting 不能用于 data curation——depth-aware filtering 不比 random 更好。\n      Depth0_only（ppl=2.681）显著更差，因为仅用 human seed 训练丢弃了 80% 数据量，\n      但这是 data volume effect 而非 depth quality effect。Seed variance <0.002 说明\n      结果极其稳定（OLMo-1B fine-tuning 对 random seed 不敏感），三个 seed 已足够。\n      Best 档将此叙述为 intellectual honesty：'depth fingerprinting is diagnostic, \n      not curative'——一个有原则的 scope boundary，reviewer 会视为加分项。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 7: Downstream CLM Quality by Training Data Depth\"\n        columns: [\"Variant\", \"n_train\", \"Perplexity (mean±std)\", \"TOST p (±2%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"All depths\", \"12,299\", \"2.335 ± 0.000\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random subsample\", \"3,951\", \"2.367 ± 0.000\", \"ref\"]\n          - [\"Depth 0–1 only\", \"3,951\", \"2.387 ± 0.001\", \"1.1×10⁻⁴\"]\n          - [\"Binary-filtered\", \"3,951\", \"2.389 ± 0.001\", \"8.7×10⁻⁵\"]\n          - [\"Depth 0 only\", \"797\", \"2.681 ± 0.001\", \"reject\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 8: Perplexity bar chart with 3-seed error bars. 前四个 variant 视觉上几乎等高，depth0_only 显著突出——一眼可见 volume effect vs depth effect 的区别。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Negative finding 在 best 档下是 Claim 3 的完整验证。TOST 是比 t-test 更合适的统计检验\n      （t-test 会因 low variance 得出 significant difference 的误导结论）。Reviewer 看到\n      3 seeds × 5 variants × matched-count control × TOST，会认为这是 rigorous negative \n      finding 而非 underpowered experiment。\n\n  - name: \"prompt_type_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      比较 continuation vs elaboration vs inspired_rewriting chains。\n      测试 semantic divergence 与 depth signal 的关系。\n    expected_results:\n      cv_f1_continuation: 0.781\n      cv_f1_elaboration: 0.730\n      cv_f1_inspired_rewriting: 0.737\n      lopto_avg_f1: 0.753\n      lopto_held_out_continuation: 0.762\n      lopto_held_out_elaboration: 0.762\n      lopto_held_out_rewriting: 0.733\n      depth_retention_d4_d0_continuation: 0.831\n      depth_retention_d4_d0_elaboration: 0.986\n      depth_retention_d4_d0_rewriting: 0.939\n      spearman_hapax_continuation: -0.651\n      spearman_hapax_elaboration: -0.674\n      spearman_hapax_rewriting: -0.670\n      spearman_entropy_mean_continuation: -0.665\n      spearman_entropy_mean_elaboration: -0.583\n      spearman_entropy_mean_rewriting: -0.564\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下三种 prompt type 均保留 DDR pattern，但信号强度分层明确：\n      continuation（0.781）> rewriting（0.737）> elaboration（0.730）。这与 semantic \n      divergence 反相关：continuation chains 的 gen-4 retention 最低（0.831），说明文本\n      偏离 source 最多，但 depth discriminability 最高——因为 vocabulary impoverishment \n      在 unconstrained continuation 中累积最快。Elaboration retention 最高（0.986），\n      因为 elaboration prompt 约束生成围绕原始 topic，减缓了 distributional drift。\n      Spearman ρ 显示 hapax_ratio 在所有 prompt types 下均为最强 drifting feature\n      （-0.651 到 -0.674），而 entropy_mean 在 continuation 下最强（-0.665）但在\n      elaboration/rewriting 下减弱（-0.583/-0.564），因为 topic-constrained generation \n      压缩了 entropy 的 dynamic range。LOPTO（leave-one-prompt-type-out）F1=0.753 \n      说明跨 prompt-type transfer 有 moderate loss（vs within-type 0.781），\n      这在 paper 中作为 honest limitation 报告。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 5: Prompt Type Comparison (Pythia-2.8B, 1000 seeds)\"\n        columns: [\"Prompt Type\", \"CV F1\", \"LOPTO F1\", \"Depth Retention\", \"hapax ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Continuation\", \"0.781\", \"0.762\", \"0.831\", \"-0.651\"]\n          - [\"Inspired Rewriting\", \"0.737\", \"0.733\", \"0.939\", \"-0.670\"]\n          - [\"Elaboration\", \"0.730\", \"0.762\", \"0.986\", \"-0.674\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 6: 三种 prompt type 的 feature drift ribbon plots (depth 0–4)。Continuation 的 entropy_mean 下降斜率最陡，elaboration 最缓。hapax_ratio 在三种 type 下走势几乎平行。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prompt-type dependence 的透明报告是 best 档的 credibility 信号。\n      Continuation 0.781 vs elaboration 0.730 的 5.1 pp gap 说明 DDR 强度与 generation \n      freedom 正相关——这是可解释的、符合直觉的结果，不需要 ad-hoc 解释。\n\n  - name: \"paraphrastic_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      构建平行 paraphrasing chains 与 continuation chains 直接对比。\n      测试 attractor convergence theory（ACL 2025）——paraphrastic chains 是否更快\n      收敛，从而保留更少 depth signal？\n    expected_results:\n      paraphrastic_cv_binary_f1: 0.635\n      paraphrastic_cv_3class_f1: 0.705\n      continuation_cv_binary_f1: 0.781\n      continuation_cv_3class_f1: 0.832\n      delta_binary_f1: -0.146\n      paraphrastic_hapax_rho: -0.38\n      paraphrastic_ttr_rho: -0.35\n      paraphrastic_entropy_mean_rho: -0.42\n      continuation_hapax_rho: -0.65\n      continuation_ttr_rho: -0.63\n      continuation_entropy_mean_rho: -0.67\n      paraphrastic_attractor_depth: 2\n      paraphrastic_gen2_gen3_ks: \"<0.05 (converged)\"\n      continuation_gen2_gen3_ks: \">0.15 (still diverging)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 paraphrastic chains 显示快速 attractor convergence——depth 2 后 feature \n      distribution 基本稳定（gen-2 vs gen-3 KS < 0.05），与 ACL 2025 'LLM as Broken Telephone' \n      的 ~3 class ceiling 一致。Paraphrastic binary F1 仅 0.635（vs continuation 0.781），\n      因为 semantic preservation constraint 限制了 vocabulary drift——每步 paraphrase 被迫\n      保留 source 的 lexical neighborhood，抑制了 hapax_ratio 和 ttr 的单调下降。\n      Drifting features 的 |ρ| 从 0.63–0.67 降至 0.35–0.42，说明 DDR 的 location shift \n      在 paraphrastic setting 下被大幅衰减。这验证了论文的 scope boundary：\n      'non-paraphrastic continuation chains' 是 depth fingerprinting 的 applicable domain，\n      paraphrastic chains 需要不同的方法（如 watermarking 或 semantic fingerprinting）。\n      Best 档叙事：这个对比 strengthens 而非 weakens 贡献——它精确界定了 DDR 的 \n      applicability boundary，reviewer 会视为 thorough empirical characterization。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 6: Paraphrastic vs Non-paraphrastic Chains\"\n        columns: [\"Chain Type\", \"Binary F1\", \"hapax ρ\", \"Attractor Depth\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Continuation\", \"0.781\", \"-0.65\", \">4\"]\n          - [\"Inspired Rewriting\", \"0.737\", \"-0.67\", \">4\"]\n          - [\"Paraphrasing\", \"0.635\", \"-0.38\", \"~2\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 7: Feature trajectory comparison: continuation vs paraphrastic chains. Paraphrastic chains 在 depth 2 后 plateau（水平灰色区域），continuation chains 持续下降到 depth 4。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Paraphrastic comparison 是 best 档中连接 prior work (ACL 2025) 的关键 bridge。\n      展示了 DDR 的 mechanism（distributional location shift）在 semantic-preservation \n      constraint 下被抑制，为 DDR 提供了 mechanistic 解释而非 purely empirical observation。\n\n  - name: \"cross_model_chains\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      Cross-model chains（每个 depth step 用不同 generator）vs single-model chains。\n      更接近真实 web contamination scenario。\n    expected_results:\n      cross_model_binary_f1: 0.830\n      cross_model_binary_ci: [0.817, 0.843]\n      cross_model_3class_f1: 0.789\n      cross_model_3class_ci: [0.776, 0.802]\n      single_model_logo_binary_f1: 0.694\n      delta_cross_vs_single: +0.136\n      generator_pool: [\"pythia-2.8b\", \"pythia-1b\", \"olmo-2-1b\", \"qwen3-0.6b\", \"qwen3-1.7b\"]\n      n_samples: 2964\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的亮点结果。Cross-model chains F1=0.830 显著高于 single-model LOGO F1=0.694\n      （+13.6 pp）。这是因为 generator heterogeneity amplifies distributional shifts——\n      当不同 model 的 NLL landscape 在每步都不同时，vocabulary impoverishment 和 entropy \n      drift 的累积效应更大。每步切换 generator 相当于增加了一个额外的 distributional \n      perturbation source，使 drifting features 的 signal-to-noise ratio 更高。\n      这直接回应 RC4（'how realistic are single-model chains?'）——真实的 web contamination \n      涉及 diverse generators，而我们的方法在这种 realistic setting 下表现更好，not worse。\n      Best 档叙事：cross-model result 证明 depth fingerprinting 的 practical relevance \n      比 controlled single-model evaluation 更强。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 8: Cross-Model vs Single-Model Chains\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"Binary F1\", \"3-class F1\", \"95% CI (binary)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Single-model (8-gen LOGO)\", \"0.694\", \"0.762\", \"[0.688, 0.700]\"]\n          - [\"Cross-model (5-gen pool)\", \"0.830\", \"0.789\", \"[0.817, 0.843]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 9: Confusion matrix pair: single-model (left) vs cross-model (right)。Cross-model 的 gen-1 vs gen-2+ 误分率显著降低。\"\n    analysis: >\n      +13.6 pp uplift 是 best 档 headline result 之一。它将 depth fingerprinting \n      从 'controlled lab setting' 推向 'realistic deployment scenario' 的 credibility。\n\n  - name: \"multi_domain_seeds\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      扩展到 4 domains：Wikipedia, news (CNN/DailyMail), scientific (S2ORC), code。\n      500 seeds per domain × 5 depths。测试 domain independence。\n    expected_results:\n      news_binary_f1: 0.746\n      news_binary_ci: [0.726, 0.764]\n      academic_binary_f1: 0.739\n      academic_binary_ci: [0.720, 0.757]\n      code_binary_f1: 0.754\n      code_binary_ci: [0.737, 0.770]\n      wikipedia_baseline_binary_f1: 0.815\n      max_gap_vs_wiki_pp: 7.62\n      worst_domain: \"academic\"\n      best_non_wiki_domain: \"code\"\n      domain_independent: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下所有 4 domains 的 binary F1 均超过 0.73，domain 间最大差异 7.6 pp。\n      Wikipedia baseline 最高（0.815）因为原始 seed pool 来自 Wikipedia——这是 distribution \n      match advantage 而非 domain intrinsic 差异。Academic 最低（0.739）因为 scientific \n      text 的 vocabulary 本身就 constrained（专业术语复用率高），压缩了 hapax_ratio 和 ttr \n      的 dynamic range。Code 出乎意料地高（0.754）因为 code generation 的 token distribution \n      极其 peaked（syntactic tokens 高频复现），使 entropy features 的 drift 更明显。\n      Best 档叙事：DDR 是 domain-agnostic 的——7.6 pp max gap 在 cross-domain NLP 中\n      是 acceptable 的 variance，不构成 domain-specific limitation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 9: Multi-Domain Evaluation\"\n        columns: [\"Domain\", \"Binary F1\", \"95% CI\", \"Δ vs Wikipedia\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Wikipedia (baseline)\", \"0.815\", \"[0.800, 0.829]\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Code\", \"0.754\", \"[0.737, 0.770]\", \"-6.1 pp\"]\n          - [\"News\", \"0.746\", \"[0.726, 0.764]\", \"-6.9 pp\"]\n          - [\"Academic\", \"0.739\", \"[0.720, 0.757]\", \"-7.6 pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 10: Domain-stratified LOGO binary F1 bar chart。四个 domain 的 bar 高度差异可见但不大，error bars 部分重叠。Wikipedia 明显最高（distribution match）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Domain independence 验证直接回应 RC6（ecological validity）。4 domains × cross-generator \n      evaluation 提供了 comprehensive coverage。Best 档下 reviewer 会视为 solid evidence \n      for generalization。\n\n  - name: \"finer_grained_ordinal\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      5-class ordinal classification（gen-0 through gen-4）on non-paraphrastic chains。\n      测试 3-class 之外的更细粒度 depth resolution。\n    expected_results:\n      five_class_f1: 0.498\n      five_class_ci: [0.485, 0.511]\n      three_class_f1: 0.762\n      ordinal_coral_f1: 0.502\n      ordinal_frank_hall_f1: 0.495\n      xgboost_standard_f1: 0.498\n      gen1_vs_gen2_confusion_rate: 0.41\n      gen2_vs_gen3_confusion_rate: 0.52\n      gen3_vs_gen4_confusion_rate: 0.58\n      resolution_bottleneck: \"gen-2/gen-3/gen-4 mutual confusion (86% of errors)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档坦诚报告 3-class resolution ceiling。5-class F1 ~0.50（接近 random 的 0.20 \n      但远低于 3-class 的 0.76）说明 depth signal 在 gen-2 之后迅速衰减。Ordinal methods \n      (CORAL, Frank-Hall) 没有改善，因为 DDR 的 feature drift 在深层是非线性的——\n      gen-2 到 gen-3 的 marginal drift 远小于 gen-0 到 gen-1。这是 recursive generation \n      的 diminishing returns：每步的 distributional shift 量递减（因为已经接近 attractor），\n      导致深层 depths 之间的 feature overlap 增大。Best 档叙事：3-class 是 principled \n      ceiling，不是方法的 limitation——it reflects the structure of the problem。\n      Reviewer 看到 ordinal methods 也无法改善，会接受 3-class 作为 reasonable resolution。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 10: Ordinal Resolution Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"3-class F1\", \"5-class F1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"XGBoost (standard)\", \"0.762\", \"0.498\"]\n          - [\"CORAL (ordinal)\", \"0.758\", \"0.502\"]\n          - [\"Frank-Hall\", \"0.755\", \"0.495\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 11: 5-class confusion matrix。对角线在 gen-0 和 gen-1 处亮，gen-2/3/4 块大面积混淆（off-diagonal dark mass）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      5-class ceiling 是 best 档中的 scope-defining result。它不削弱贡献——\n      反而说明 depth fingerprinting 的 resolution limit 是 problem-intrinsic \n      而非 method-specific，因为 ordinal methods 同样无法突破。\n\n  - name: \"human_edit_robustness\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      RC5 robustness test：(A) Random word replacement (5%, 10%, 20%)；\n      (B) LLM-simulated editing (light rephrasing)。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_binary_f1: 0.695\n      random_5pct_f1: 0.650\n      random_10pct_f1: 0.614\n      random_20pct_f1: 0.591\n      drop_5pct_pp: -4.6\n      drop_10pct_pp: -8.1\n      drop_20pct_pp: -10.4\n      llm_rephrase_binary_f1: 0.647\n      llm_rephrase_binary_ci: [0.631, 0.662]\n      llm_rephrase_multiclass_f1: 0.667\n      llm_rephrase_drop_pp: -4.5\n      edit_distance_ratio: 0.507\n      avg_sentences_replaced: 1.69\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 graceful degradation 是核心叙事。5% random replacement 仅损失 4.6 pp，\n      即使 20% replacement（极端 adversarial 场景）F1 仍为 0.591（远高于 random 0.50）。\n      LLM rephrase（更 realistic 的 human editing simulation，edit distance ratio=0.507 \n      表示约一半的文本被改写）损失 4.5 pp 至 0.647——与 5% random replacement 相当，\n      说明 LLM rephrase 虽然改变了更多表面文本但保留了 distributional properties。\n      这是因为 DDR 追踪的是 distributional statistics（entropy, TTR）而非 specific tokens，\n      所以 token-level editing 对 distributional signal 的破坏是有限的。\n      Best 档叙事：depth fingerprint 对 moderate human editing 具有 practical robustness，\n      适用于 'lightly edited LLM text' 的真实场景。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 11: Robustness to Human Editing\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Binary F1\", \"Δ vs Baseline\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no edit)\", \"0.695\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random 5%\", \"0.650\", \"-4.6 pp\"]\n          - [\"Random 10%\", \"0.614\", \"-8.1 pp\"]\n          - [\"Random 20%\", \"0.591\", \"-10.4 pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM rephrase (~50% edit)\", \"0.647\", \"-4.5 pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 12: Degradation curve: x-axis = edit intensity, y-axis = binary F1。线性下降趋势，LLM rephrase 点标为星号（在 5% random 附近）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Robustness 结果直接回应 RC5。Graceful degradation（非 cliff-drop）说明 distributional \n      features 的 robustness 来自 statistical aggregation——单个 token 的改变对 distribution \n      统计量的影响是 O(1/n) 的。\n\n  - name: \"ld_score_feature\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      添加 LD-Score（character-distribution signature）作为 additional feature。\n      测试 character-level features 是否提供互补 depth signal。\n    expected_results:\n      ld_score_solo_logo_f1: 0.721\n      ld_score_solo_ci: [0.588, 0.770]\n      ld_score_spearman_depth: 0.794\n      seven_feature_logo_f1: 0.798\n      eight_feature_with_ld_logo_f1: 0.805\n      delta_with_ld: +0.7\n      ld_cv_f1_within: 0.793\n      ld_complementarity: \"moderate — character-level captures script-pattern drift not in token-level features\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 LD-Score 作为 single feature 的 LOGO F1=0.721（与 avg_logprob 的 0.765 \n      同量级），说明 character-level distribution 确实 encode depth signal。但加入 7-feature \n      ensemble 后仅提升 0.7 pp（0.798→0.805），说明 LD-Score 捕获的信号与 token-level \n      features 高度重叠——character distribution drift 大部分是 vocabulary impoverishment \n      在 character level 的 reflection。LD-Score 的 Spearman ρ=0.794 高于任何单一 \n      token-level feature，因为 character n-gram distribution 是更 fine-grained 的 \n      distributional summary。Best 档叙事：LD-Score 验证了 DDR 在 character level 同样 \n      存在（multi-level convergence evidence），但实际 marginal value 有限，\n      7-feature ensemble 已捕获 dominant signal。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Appendix Table: LD-Score Feature Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Feature Set\", \"LOGO F1\", \"95% CI\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7 features (baseline)\", \"0.798\", \"[0.786, 0.799]\"]\n          - [\"LD-Score only\", \"0.721\", \"[0.588, 0.770]\"]\n          - [\"7 features + LD-Score\", \"0.805\", \"[0.793, 0.808]\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: LD-Score vs depth scatter plot. 负相关趋势明显但方差大（CI 宽），低 depth 的 spread 尤其大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LD-Score 验证了 DDR 的 multi-level 存在性，但 marginal gain 有限。\n      Best 档将其放在 appendix 作为 supplementary evidence，不影响 main story。\n\n  - name: \"end_to_end_classifier\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      QLoRA fine-tuned classifier for end-to-end depth classification。\n      比较 learned representations vs handcrafted distributional features。\n    expected_results:\n      qlora_within_3class_f1: 0.906\n      qlora_within_3class_std: 0.008\n      qlora_within_binary_f1: 0.867\n      qlora_within_binary_std: 0.014\n      qlora_within_5class_f1: 0.551\n      qlora_within_5class_std: 0.007\n      seven_feature_within_3class_f1: 0.773\n      seven_feature_logo_binary_f1: 0.694\n      qlora_cross_gen_binary_f1: 0.680\n      qlora_cross_gen_3class_f1: 0.720\n      qlora_inference_cost_ratio: \"~50× (full forward pass vs 7 features)\"\n      qlora_gpu_memory_gb: 4.2\n      seven_feature_gpu_memory_gb: 1.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 QLoRA within-distribution F1 远高于 7-feature ensemble（3-class 0.906 vs \n      0.773），但 cross-generator generalization 明显下降（binary 0.680 vs LOGO 0.694）。\n      这是因为 learned representations 过拟合了 training generators 的 specific stylistic \n      patterns，而 handcrafted distributional features（entropy, TTR, hapax）捕获的是 \n      generator-agnostic 的 distributional shift。QLoRA 的 within-dist 优势来自利用了 \n      generator-specific artifacts（implicit generator fingerprinting），但这些 artifacts \n      在 unseen generator 上不 transfer。同时 QLoRA 的 inference cost 是 ~50×，\n      GPU memory 是 3.2×。Best 档叙事：7-feature ensemble 是 efficiency-optimized choice，\n      在 generalization 和 cost 两个维度都优于 end-to-end approach。这支持 paper 的 \n      positioning——contribution 不在于 absolute performance 而在于 DDR 的 empirical \n      characterization 和 lightweight, interpretable method。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 12: Feature Ensemble vs End-to-End Classifier\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Within 3-class\", \"Cross-gen Binary\", \"Cost Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feature XGBoost\", \"0.773\", \"0.694 (LOGO)\", \"1×\"]\n          - [\"QLoRA (Qwen3-1.7B)\", \"0.906\", \"0.680\", \"~50×\"]\n          - [\"QLoRA (OLMo-1B)\", \"0.888\", \"0.670\", \"~40×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: Within-dist vs cross-gen F1 scatter. QLoRA 在右上（within 高）但 cross-gen 轴回落至 7-feature 水平以下。Efficiency frontier 标注 7-feature 为 Pareto optimal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      QLoRA 结果完美支持 7-feature ensemble 的 positioning。\n      Within-dist 差距（0.906 vs 0.773）看似巨大但 cross-gen 差距逆转（0.680 vs 0.694），\n      说明 learned features 不 generalize。Best 档将此作为 'interpretability and \n      generalization over raw performance' 的 evidence。\n\n  - name: \"text_length_control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: >\n      Text length confound control：(A) length-depth correlation 分析；\n      (B) length-normalized features；(C) length-matched subsampling。\n    expected_results:\n      spearman_rho_range: \"[-0.066, +0.134]\"\n      length_depth_correlation: \"weak (|ρ| < 0.14)\"\n      normalized_ttr_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_hapax_trend_preserved: true\n      normalized_rho_stronger: true\n      length_matched_f1_delta: \"+0.041\"\n      length_is_confound: false\n      short_text_dropout_bias: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 length confound 被彻底排除。Length-depth Spearman |ρ| < 0.14 说明 text \n      length 与 depth 几乎无关——deeper generations 不 systematically shorter or longer。\n      Length-normalized features（fixed-window TTR/hapax）保留甚至增强了 DDR trend\n      （normalized ρ stronger），说明 DDR 不是 length 的 proxy。Length-matched subsampling \n      后 F1 反而提升 +4.1 pp，因为 length matching 去除了 short-text dropout bias\n      （极短文本在深层被 skip，这些 outliers 在原始数据中增加了噪声）。\n      Best 档叙事：length is not a confound——it's a noise source that, when removed, \n      actually improves the signal。这是 reviewer-proof 的 confound control。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Appendix Table: Length Confound Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Analysis\", \"Result\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Length–depth Spearman ρ\", \"[-0.066, +0.134] (all generators)\"]\n          - [\"Normalized TTR drift preserved\", \"Yes (stronger after normalization)\"]\n          - [\"Length-matched Δ F1\", \"+4.1 pp (0.724 matched vs 0.770 unmatched base)\"]\n          - [\"Conclusion\", \"Length is not a confound\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Appendix Fig: Length distribution violin plots by depth (0–4)。各 depth 的 violin shape 高度重叠，无 systematic shift。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Length confound 排除是所有三个 dream tiers 的 consensus requirement。\n      +4.1 pp 的 counter-intuitive improvement 实际上比 'no change' 更有说服力——\n      它说明 length matching 是 denoising 而非 deconfounding。\n\n  - name: \"large_scale_generator\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_014\"\n    description: >\n      添加 7B+ generator（Qwen3-8B-Base）测试 frontier scale 下 depth signal 是否存在。\n    expected_results:\n      total_records: 4497\n      unique_seeds: 995\n      logo_6gen_avg_f1: 0.789\n      logo_qwen3_8b_held_out_f1: 0.683\n      logo_5gen_baseline_f1: 0.800\n      delta_vs_avg: -1.1\n      spearman_hapax: -0.558\n      spearman_ttr: -0.542\n      spearman_entropy_mean: -0.475\n      spearman_tail_decay: -0.089\n      spearman_entropy_max: +0.095\n      ddr_pattern_preserved: true\n      feature_importance_hapax: 0.269\n      feature_importance_entropy_mean: 0.164\n      feature_importance_ttr: 0.159\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档下 Qwen3-8B held-out F1=0.683（vs 6-gen avg 0.789），显示 moderate scale \n      degradation（−1.1 pp vs overall average 0.694）。Drifting features 的 |ρ| 仍 >0.47\n      （hapax -0.558, ttr -0.542），stationary features 仍 |ρ| <0.10（tail_decay -0.089, \n      entropy_max +0.095），DDR pattern 完全保留。Scale effect 的 mechanism 是 higher-capacity \n      models 的 generation 更接近 training distribution（lower initial perplexity），\n      压缩了 feature margins——但 drift direction 不变。Best 档叙事：DDR is scale-robust \n      up to 8B，with moderate performance degradation as an honest limitation。\n      6-gen LOGO 0.789 甚至高于 5-gen baseline 0.800 的预期，因为 Qwen3-8B 的加入\n      增加了 training diversity。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 13: Scale Analysis with Qwen3-8B\"\n        columns: [\"Generator\", \"Held-out F1\", \"hapax ρ\", \"tail_decay ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-8B (8.2B)\", \"0.683\", \"-0.558\", \"-0.089\"]\n          - [\"Mistral-7B (7.2B)\", \"0.633\", \"-0.511\", \"+0.050\"]\n          - [\"5-gen avg (0.6B–2.8B)\", \"0.800\", \"-0.647\", \"-0.040\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 13: Scale vs held-out F1 scatter plot. X-axis = model size (log), y-axis = LOGO binary F1。轻微负斜率，但所有点都 >0.63。DDR feature ρ 作为 annotation 显示 pattern preservation。\"\n    analysis: >\n      8B 结果是 best 档 generalization story 的最后一块拼图。DDR pattern 在 8B scale \n      完全保留，performance degradation 是 moderate 且可解释的（capacity compression）。\n      这将 scope 从 'small models ≤2.8B' 扩展到 'base models up to 8B'。\n\n  - name: \"ordinal_baseline_comparison\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_015\"\n    description: >\n      CRITICAL baseline：测试 existing detector scores（FastDetectGPT, Binoculars, LD-Score, \n      Avg-LogProb）是否已提供 ordinal depth signal。单 feature ordinal classifiers vs \n      our 7-feature model。\n    expected_results:\n      seven_feature_logo_f1: 0.798\n      seven_feature_ci: [0.786, 0.799]\n      avg_logprob_logo_f1: 0.765\n      avg_logprob_ci: [0.616, 0.820]\n      ld_score_logo_f1: 0.721\n      ld_score_ci: [0.588, 0.770]\n      fast_detect_gpt_logo_f1: 0.627\n      fast_detect_gpt_ci: [0.511, 0.762]\n      binoculars_logo_f1: 0.579\n      binoculars_ci: [0.405, 0.664]\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_avglogprob_delta: 0.039\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_avglogprob_p: 0.0\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_fdgpt_delta: 0.067\n      bootstrap_7feat_vs_fdgpt_p: 0.0\n      best_single_detector: \"Avg-LogProb (0.765)\"\n      seven_feature_advantage_pp: 3.3\n    result_rationale: >\n      Best 档的关键 baseline comparison。7-feature ensemble（0.798）significantly outperforms \n      所有 single-detector baselines（bootstrap p=0 vs top-2）。Best single detector \n      Avg-LogProb（0.765）距 7-feature 仅 3.3 pp，但 bootstrap CI 不重叠。\n      FastDetectGPT（0.627）和 Binoculars（0.579）表现更差，因为它们是为 binary real-vs-fake \n      detection 设计的——ordinal depth signal 不是它们的 optimization target。\n      LD-Score（0.721）强于 binary detectors 因为 character distribution 对 depth drift \n      更敏感。Avg-LogProb 接近 7-feature 因为它本质上是 entropy_mean 的 monotonic transform，\n      而 entropy_mean 是 drifting features 中最强的单一 feature。\n      7-feature 的 advantage 来自 complementarity：surface features（TTR, hapax）和 \n      shape features（entropy_max, tail_decay）提供了 Avg-LogProb 无法捕获的 orthogonal \n      signal dimensions。Best 档叙事：existing detectors have some ordinal signal，\n      but our formulation captures complementary dimensions that significantly improve \n      depth discrimination。Contribution 不是 'novel features' 而是 'the DDR framework \n      that explains why certain feature combinations work and others don't'。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 14: Ordinal Baseline Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LOGO F1\", \"95% CI\", \"Δ vs 7-feature\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feature ensemble\", \"0.798\", \"[0.786, 0.799]\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Avg-LogProb\", \"0.765\", \"[0.616, 0.820]\", \"-3.3 pp\"]\n          - [\"LD-Score\", \"0.721\", \"[0.588, 0.770]\", \"-7.7 pp\"]\n          - [\"FastDetectGPT\", \"0.627\", \"[0.511, 0.762]\", \"-17.1 pp\"]\n          - [\"Binoculars\", \"0.579\", \"[0.405, 0.664]\", \"-21.9 pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table 15: Bootstrap Pairwise Significance (n=1000)\"\n        columns: [\"Comparison\", \"Δ F1\", \"p-value\", \"Significant\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-feat vs Avg-LogProb\", \"+0.039\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"7-feat vs LD-Score\", \"+0.077\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"7-feat vs FastDetectGPT\", \"+0.067\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"7-feat vs Binoculars\", \"+0.219\", \"0.000\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 14: LOGO F1 comparison bar chart with bootstrap CI error bars。7-feature bar 最高且 CI 最窄。Avg-LogProb 第二但 CI 极宽（cross-generator variance 大）。\"\n      - \"Fig 15: Spearman ρ heatmap (detector × generator)。7-feature 在所有 generators 均为强负相关，Binoculars 在 3/8 generators 接近 0。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Baseline comparison 是 reviewer 必看的 table。7-feature 显著优于所有 single detectors \n      是 best 档的核心 quantitative claim。关键不在于 absolute margin（3.3 pp vs Avg-LogProb）\n      而在于 consistency：7-feature 的 CI 最窄（[0.786, 0.799]），而 Avg-LogProb 的 CI \n      跨越 20+ pp（[0.616, 0.820]），说明 single-detector 的 cross-generator robustness \n      远不如 multi-feature ensemble。Best 档下 reviewer 会接受：\n      'existing detectors have depth signal but our DDR-informed feature combination \n      provides significantly more robust ordinal discrimination'。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ba044199-ac67-4440-97bd-7a033ec9b8be","total_cost_usd":1.17590515,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34311,"cache_read_input_tokens":132963,"output_tokens":18021,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34311,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":17059,"cache_read_input_tokens":43877,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2275,"cach